  ($id$int-m-01$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int 5x^4\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^5 + C","correct":true},{"latex":"5x^5 + C","correct":false},{"latex":"20x^3 + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{5x^5}{4} + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Fórmulas (2) y (4): $5 \cdot \frac{x^5}{5} = x^5 + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-02$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿Qué sustitución $u$ resuelve $\int 2x\,e^{x^2}\,dx$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"u = x^2","correct":true},{"latex":"u = e^{x^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"u = 2x","correct":false},{"latex":"u = x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Si $u = x^2$, entonces $du = 2x\,dx$, que coincide con el factor presente.$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-03$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int (x^2 + 1)^5 \cdot 2x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{(x^2 + 1)^6}{6} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{(x^2 + 1)^6}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^2 + 1)^6 + C","correct":false},{"latex":"10(x^2 + 1)^4 + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x^2 + 1$, $du = 2x\,dx$: fórmula (4), $\frac{u^6}{6} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-04$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int 2x\,e^{x^2}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"e^{x^2} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"e^{x^2} + x e^{x^2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 e^{x^2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"2 e^{x^2} + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x^2$, $du = 2x\,dx$: $\int e^u\,du = e^{x^2} + C$ (fórmula 7).$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-05$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\,e^{x^2}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}e^{x^2} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"e^{x^2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x e^{x^2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}x e^{x^2} + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x^2$, $du = 2x\,dx$, falta un $2$: $\frac{1}{2}\int e^u\,du = \frac{1}{2}e^{x^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-06$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \frac{dx}{3x}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}\\ln|x| + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\ln|x| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"3\\ln|x| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln|3x| + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Fórmula (2) y (5): $\frac{1}{3}\int\frac{dx}{x} = \frac{1}{3}\ln|x| + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-07$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \frac{2x}{x^2 + 1}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\ln(x^2 + 1) + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\ln|x| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x^2+1} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"2\\ln(x^2+1) + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x^2 + 1$, $du = 2x\,dx$: $\int\frac{du}{u} = \ln|u| + C$ (fórmula 5).$exp$),
  ($id$int-m-08$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$inmediatas$sub$, $law$inmediatas$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\,\sin(x^2)\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos(x^2) + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\cos(x^2) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\cos(x^2) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\cos(x^2) + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x^2$, $du = 2x\,dx$: $\frac{1}{2}\int\sin u\,du = -\frac{1}{2}\cos(x^2) + C$.$exp$),
