  ($id$par-f-96$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Para resolver $\int x^{2} e^x\,dx$ por partes, según la regla LIATE, ¿cuál es $u$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"u = e^x","correct":false},{"latex":"u = dx","correct":false},{"latex":"u = x^{2} e^x","correct":false},{"latex":"u = x^{2}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$En LIATE, la función algebraica ($A = x^{2}$) tiene prioridad sobre la exponencial ($E = e^x$) para ser $u$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-f-97$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$En $\int x\sin(3x)\,dx$ eligiendo $u = x$, ¿cuál es $dv$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"dv = x\\,dx","correct":false},{"latex":"dv = \\sin(3x)","correct":false},{"latex":"dv = \\cos(3x)\\,dx","correct":false},{"latex":"dv = \\sin(3x)\\,dx","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Si $u = x$, el factor restante del integrando es $dv = \sin(3x)\,dx$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-f-98$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Si $dv = e^{2x}\,dx$, ¿cuál es la función $v$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"v = e^{2x}","correct":false},{"latex":"v = \\frac{1}{4}e^{2x}","correct":false},{"latex":"v = 2e^{2x}","correct":false},{"latex":"v = \\frac{1}{2}e^{2x}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Integrando $dv$: $v = \int e^{2x}\,dx = \frac{1}{2}e^{2x}$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-f-99$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuál es el término faltante en la fórmula: $\int u\,dv = uv - \dots$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\int v\\,dv","correct":false},{"latex":"\\int du\\,dv","correct":false},{"latex":"\\int u\\,du","correct":false},{"latex":"\\int v\\,du","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$La fórmula fundamental de integración por partes es $\int u\,dv = uv - \int v\,du$.$exp$)
INSERT INTO eqd.questions (id, section_id, subtema_id, law_id, difficulty, prompt, options, explanation)
VALUES
  ($id$par-m-01$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\,\cos x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x\\sin x + \\cos x + C","correct":true},{"latex":"x\\sin x - \\cos x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-x\\sin x + \\cos x + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$u = x$, $dv = \cos x\,dx$: $x\sin x - \int\sin x\,dx = x\sin x + \cos x + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-02$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\,\ln x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x^2}{2}\\ln x - \\frac{x^2}{4} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2}{2}\\ln x + \\frac{x^2}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2}{2}\\ln x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x\\ln x - x + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$u = \ln x$, $dv = x\,dx$: $\frac{x^2}{2}\ln x - \int\frac{x}{2}\,dx = \frac{x^2}{2}\ln x - \frac{x^2}{4} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-03$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x^2\,e^x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 e^x - 2x e^x + 2e^x + C","correct":true},{"latex":"x^2 e^x - 2x e^x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 e^x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"2x e^x + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Dos pasadas de partes (o tabla): $x^2 e^x - 2x e^x + 2e^x + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-04$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \ln x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x\\ln x - x + C","correct":true},{"latex":"x\\ln x + x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x\\ln x + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$u = \ln x$, $dv = dx$: $x\ln x - \int x\cdot\frac{1}{x}\,dx = x\ln x - x + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-05$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \arctan x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x\\arctan x - \\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1 + x^2) + C","correct":true},{"latex":"x\\arctan x + \\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1 + x^2) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x\\arctan x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x}{1 + x^2} + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$u = \arctan x$, $dv = dx$: $x\arctan x - \int\frac{x}{1+x^2}\,dx$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-06$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Según LIATE, ¿qué eliges como $u$ en $\int x^2\,\sin x\,dx$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"u = x^2","correct":true},{"latex":"u = \\sin x","correct":false},{"latex":"u = \\cos x","correct":false},{"latex":"u = x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Algebraica ($x^2$) va antes que trigonométrica en LIATE: $u = x^2$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-07$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\,e^{2x}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x}{2}e^{2x} - \\frac{1}{4}e^{2x} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{x}{2}e^{2x} + \\frac{1}{4}e^{2x} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x e^{2x} - e^{2x} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x}{2}e^{2x} + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$u = x$, $dv = e^{2x}dx$: $\frac{x}{2}e^{2x} - \int\frac{1}{2}e^{2x}\,dx = \frac{x}{2}e^{2x} - \frac{1}{4}e^{2x} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-08$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$En $\int x\,\cos x\,dx$ con $u = x$, ¿cuál es $dv$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"dv = \\cos x\\,dx","correct":true},{"latex":"dv = \\sin x\\,dx","correct":false},{"latex":"dv = x\\,dx","correct":false},{"latex":"dv = \\cos x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x$, el resto es $dv = \cos x\,dx$, luego $v = \sin x$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-09$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\,\sec^2 x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x\\tan x + \\ln|\\cos x| + C","correct":true},{"latex":"x\\tan x - \\ln|\\cos x| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x\\tan x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan x + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$u = x$, $dv = \sec^2 x\,dx$: $x\tan x - \int\tan x\,dx = x\tan x + \ln|\cos x| + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-10$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Para $\int e^x\,\sin x\,dx$, ¿cuántas veces se aplica integración por partes?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\text{Dos veces (caso cíclico)}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\text{Una sola vez}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\text{Tres veces}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\text{No se puede aplicar}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Tras dos pasadas reaparece la integral original y se despeja.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-100$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula por partes: $\int x e^{2x}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x e^{2x}}{2} + \\frac{e^{2x}}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{2x}}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x e^{2x} - \\frac{e^{2x}}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x e^{2x}}{2} - \\frac{e^{2x}}{4} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x, dv = e^{2x}\,dx \implies du = dx, v = \frac{e^{2x}}{2}$. Entonces $uv - \int v\,du = \frac{x e^{2x}}{2} - \frac{e^{2x}}{2^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-11$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x^{4}\ln x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^{5}\\ln x - \\frac{x^{5}}{5} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{4}\\ln x}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{5}\\ln x}{5} + \\frac{x^{5}}{25} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{5}\\ln x}{5} - \\frac{x^{5}}{25} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = \ln x$ (logarítmica prioritaria en LIATE) y $dv = x^{4}\,dx \implies du = \frac{1}{x}\,dx, v = \frac{x^{5}}{5}$. Queda $\frac{x^{5}\ln x}{5} - \frac{x^{5}}{5^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-12$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula por partes: $\int x e^{4x}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x e^{4x} - \\frac{e^{4x}}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{4x}}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x e^{4x}}{4} + \\frac{e^{4x}}{16} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x e^{4x}}{4} - \\frac{e^{4x}}{16} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x, dv = e^{4x}\,dx \implies du = dx, v = \frac{e^{4x}}{4}$. Entonces $uv - \int v\,du = \frac{x e^{4x}}{4} - \frac{e^{4x}}{4^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-13$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\cos(5x)\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x\\sin(5x)}{5} - \\frac{\\cos(5x)}{25} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{x\\sin(5x)}{5} + \\frac{\\cos(5x)}{25} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2\\cos(5x)}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x\\sin(5x)}{5} + \\frac{\\cos(5x)}{25} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x, dv = \cos(5x)\,dx \implies du = dx, v = \frac{\sin(5x)}{5}$. Luego $uv - \int v\,du = \frac{x\sin(5x)}{5} + \frac{\cos(5x)}{5^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-14$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\sin(6x)\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x\\cos(6x)}{6} + \\frac{\\sin(6x)}{36} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2\\sin(6x)}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{x\\cos(6x)}{6} - \\frac{\\sin(6x)}{36} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{x\\cos(6x)}{6} + \\frac{\\sin(6x)}{36} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x, dv = \sin(6x)\,dx \implies du = dx, v = -\frac{\cos(6x)}{6}$. Resulta $-\frac{x\cos(6x)}{6} + \frac{\sin(6x)}{6^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-15$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x^{4}\ln x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x^{5}\\ln x}{5} + \\frac{x^{5}}{25} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{4}\\ln x}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{5}\\ln x - \\frac{x^{5}}{5} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{5}\\ln x}{5} - \\frac{x^{5}}{25} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = \ln x$ (logarítmica prioritaria en LIATE) y $dv = x^{4}\,dx \implies du = \frac{1}{x}\,dx, v = \frac{x^{5}}{5}$. Queda $\frac{x^{5}\ln x}{5} - \frac{x^{5}}{5^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-16$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula por partes: $\int x e^{3x}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x e^{3x} - \\frac{e^{3x}}{3} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{3x}}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x e^{3x}}{3} + \\frac{e^{3x}}{9} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x e^{3x}}{3} - \\frac{e^{3x}}{9} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x, dv = e^{3x}\,dx \implies du = dx, v = \frac{e^{3x}}{3}$. Entonces $uv - \int v\,du = \frac{x e^{3x}}{3} - \frac{e^{3x}}{3^2} + C$.$exp$),
