  ($id$par-m-22$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x\sin(4x)\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-\\frac{x\\cos(4x)}{4} - \\frac{\\sin(4x)}{16} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2\\sin(4x)}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x\\cos(4x)}{4} + \\frac{\\sin(4x)}{16} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{x\\cos(4x)}{4} + \\frac{\\sin(4x)}{16} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = x, dv = \sin(4x)\,dx \implies du = dx, v = -\frac{\cos(4x)}{4}$. Resulta $-\frac{x\cos(4x)}{4} + \frac{\sin(4x)}{4^2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-m-23$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int x^{4}\ln x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x^{5}\\ln x}{5} + \\frac{x^{5}}{25} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{5}\\ln x - \\frac{x^{5}}{5} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{4}\\ln x}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^{5}\\ln x}{5} - \\frac{x^{5}}{25} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = \ln x$ (logarítmica prioritaria en LIATE) y $dv = x^{4}\,dx \implies du = \frac{1}{x}\,dx, v = \frac{x^{5}}{5}$. Queda $\frac{x^{5}\ln x}{5} - \frac{x^{5}}{5^2} + C$.$exp$),
