  ($id$par-h-93$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula integrando por partes dos veces: $\int x^2 e^{2x}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{2x}}{2} + \\frac{2x e^{2x}}{4} + \\frac{2e^{2x}}{8} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 e^{2x} - \\frac{2x e^{2x}}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^3 e^{2x}}{32} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{2x}}{2} - \\frac{2x e^{2x}}{4} + \\frac{2e^{2x}}{8} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Reduciendo la potencia sucesivamente por partes con $u = x^2$ y luego $u = x$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-h-94$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula la integral cíclica por partes: $\int e^x \cos x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{e^x(\\cos x - \\sin x)}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{e^x\\sin x}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"e^x(\\cos x + \\sin x) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{e^x(\\cos x + \\sin x)}{2} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Aplicando partes dos veces, reaparece la integral original $I$. Despejando $2I = e^x(\cos x + \sin x) \implies I = \frac{e^x(\cos x + \sin x)}{2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-h-95$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula integrando por partes: $\int (\ln x)^2\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x(\\ln x)^2 + 2x\\ln x + 2x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x(\\ln x)^2 - x\\ln x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{(\\ln x)^3}{3} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x(\\ln x)^2 - 2x\\ln x + 2x + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = (\ln x)^2, dv = dx \implies du = 2\frac{\ln x}{x}dx, v = x$. Luego $x(\ln x)^2 - 2\int \ln x\,dx = x(\ln x)^2 - 2(x\ln x - x) + C = x(\ln x)^2 - 2x\ln x + 2x + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-h-96$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Aplica partes dos veces para calcular: $\int x^2 e^x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 e^x + 2x e^x + 2e^x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 e^x - 2x e^x - 2e^x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^3 e^x}{3} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 e^x - 2x e^x + 2e^x + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Primera aplicación: $x^2 e^x - 2\int x e^x\,dx$. Segunda aplicación: $x^2 e^x - 2(x e^x - e^x) + C = x^2 e^x - 2x e^x + 2e^x + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-h-97$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula la integral cíclica por partes: $\int e^x \sin x\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{e^x(\\sin x + \\cos x)}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"e^x(\\sin x - \\cos x) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{e^x\\cos x}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{e^x(\\sin x - \\cos x)}{2} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Integrando dos veces por partes y despejando la integral $I$: $I = \frac{e^x(\sin x - \cos x)}{2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-h-98$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula integrando por partes: $\int (\ln x)^2\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x(\\ln x)^2 + 2x\\ln x + 2x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x(\\ln x)^2 - x\\ln x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{(\\ln x)^3}{3} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x(\\ln x)^2 - 2x\\ln x + 2x + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $u = (\ln x)^2, dv = dx \implies du = 2\frac{\ln x}{x}dx, v = x$. Luego $x(\ln x)^2 - 2\int \ln x\,dx = x(\ln x)^2 - 2(x\ln x - x) + C = x(\ln x)^2 - 2x\ln x + 2x + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$par-h-99$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$partes$sub$, $law$partes$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula integrando por partes dos veces: $\int x^2 e^{4x}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{4x}}{4} + \\frac{2x e^{4x}}{16} + \\frac{2e^{4x}}{64} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^3 e^{4x}}{34} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 e^{4x} - \\frac{2x e^{4x}}{4} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2 e^{4x}}{4} - \\frac{2x e^{4x}}{16} + \\frac{2e^{4x}}{64} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Reduciendo la potencia sucesivamente por partes con $u = x^2$ y luego $u = x$.$exp$)
