VALUES
  ($id$fra-h-01$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \frac{dx}{x^2 - 4x + 3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-3}{x-1}\\right| + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-1}{x-3}\\right| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln|x^2 - 4x + 3| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\arctan(x-2) + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Factoriza $(x-1)(x-3)$. Con $A=-\frac{1}{2}$, $B=\frac{1}{2}$: $\frac{1}{2}\ln\left|\frac{x-3}{x-1}\right| + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-02$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \frac{x}{x^2 - 1}\,dx$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x^2 - 1| + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-1}{x+1}\\right| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln|x^2 - 1| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\arctan x + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El numerador es $\frac{1}{2}$ veces la derivada del denominador: $\frac{1}{2}\ln|x^2-1| + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-03$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuál es la descomposición de $\frac{1}{x(x-1)^2}$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{A}{x} + \\frac{B}{x-1} + \\frac{C}{(x-1)^2}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{A}{x} + \\frac{B}{(x-1)^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{A}{x} + \\frac{B}{x-1}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{Ax + B}{x(x-1)^2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Lineal simple $x$ + lineal repetido $(x-1)^2$: tres términos.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-04$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \frac{dx}{x^2 + 2x + 2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\arctan(x + 1) + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{x+1}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln(x^2 + 2x + 2) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\arctan(x + 2) + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El denominador es irreducible: $(x+1)^2 + 1$. Fórmula (18) con $a=1$.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-05$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$En $\frac{x}{x^2 - 1} = \frac{A}{x-1} + \frac{B}{x+1}$, ¿cuánto valen $A$ y $B$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"A = \\frac{1}{2},\\ B = \\frac{1}{2}","correct":true},{"latex":"A = \\frac{1}{2},\\ B = -\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"A = 1,\\ B = -1","correct":false},{"latex":"A = -\\frac{1}{2},\\ B = \\frac{1}{2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x = A(x+1) + B(x-1)$: en $x=1$ da $A=\frac{1}{2}$; en $x=-1$ da $B=\frac{1}{2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-06$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Cómo se factoriza $x^3 - x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x(x - 1)(x + 1)","correct":true},{"latex":"x(x^2 - 1)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^2 - 1)(x + 1)","correct":false},{"latex":"x(x - 1)^2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^3 - x = x(x^2 - 1) = x(x-1)(x+1)$, tres lineales distintos.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-07$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\int \frac{dx}{x^2(x+1)}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{A}{x} + \\frac{B}{x^2} + \\frac{C}{x+1} \\text{ (descomponer)}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{A}{x^2} + \\frac{B}{x+1}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{A}{x} + \\frac{B}{x+1}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{Ax+B}{x^2(x+1)}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Lineal repetido $x^2$ (dos términos) + lineal simple $x+1$: $\frac{A}{x} + \frac{B}{x^2} + \frac{C}{x+1}$.$exp$),
  ($id$fra-h-08$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$fracciones-parciales$sub$, $law$fracciones-parciales$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuál integral se resuelve con fracciones parciales?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\int \\frac{dx}{x^2 - 5x + 6}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\int \\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2 + 1}}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\int x\\,e^x\\,dx","correct":false},{"latex":"\\int \\cos x\\,dx","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^2 - 5x + 6 = (x-2)(x-3)$: cociente de polinomios factorizable, ideal para fracciones parciales.$exp$),
