  ($id$sust-h-01$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula $\int \frac{dx}{x^2 + 4}$ usando $x = 2\tan\theta$.$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{x}{2} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\arctan\\frac{x}{2} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}\\arctan x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln(x^2 + 4) + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$dx = 2\sec^2\theta\,d\theta$; la integral da $\frac{1}{2}\theta + C = \frac{1}{2}\arctan\frac{x}{2} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-02$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula $\int \frac{dx}{\sqrt{9 - x^2}}$ usando $x = 3\sin\theta$.$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\arcsin\\frac{x}{3} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\arcsin\\frac{x}{9} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}\\arcsin x + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\arccos\\frac{x}{3} + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\int d\theta = \theta + C = \arcsin\frac{x}{3} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-03$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula $\int \frac{dx}{x\sqrt{x^2 - 9}}$ usando $x = 3\sec\theta$.$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsec}\\frac{x}{3} + C","correct":true},{"latex":"\\operatorname{arcsec}\\frac{x}{3} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}\\arctan\\frac{x}{3} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}\\ln\\left|x + \\sqrt{x^2-9}\\right| + C","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Simplifica a $\int\frac{1}{3}\,d\theta = \frac{1}{3}\theta + C = \frac{1}{3}\operatorname{arcsec}\frac{x}{3} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-04$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Para qué se usa principalmente la sustitución trigonométrica?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\text{Eliminar raíces cuadradas usando identidades pitagóricas}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\text{Convertir logaritmos en potencias}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\text{Derivar funciones compuestas}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\text{Resolver ecuaciones diferenciales lineales}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Convierte $\sqrt{a^2 \pm x^2}$ o $\sqrt{x^2 - a^2}$ en expresiones trigonométricas sin raíz.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-05$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula usando $x = 7\tan\theta$: $\int \frac{dx}{\sqrt{x^2 + 49}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\ln\\left|\\frac{x}{7} + \\sqrt{x^2 + 49}\\right| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{7}\\arctan\\left(\\frac{x}{7}\\right) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sqrt{x^2 + 49} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln\\left|x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 49}\\right| + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $x = 7\tan\theta, dx = 7\sec^2\theta\,d\theta$, la integral queda $\int \sec\theta\,d\theta = \ln|\sec\theta + \tan\theta| + C' = \ln|x + \sqrt{x^2 + 49}| + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-06$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Resuelve mediante sustitución trigonométrica $x = 2\sin\theta$: $\int \frac{dx}{\sqrt{4 - x^2}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{4 - x^2}} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\arccos\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right) + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Sustituyendo $x = 2\sin\theta, dx = 2\cos\theta\,d\theta$. El radical es $\sqrt{4(1 - \sin^2\theta)} = 2\cos\theta$. La integral queda $\int \frac{2\cos\theta\,d\theta}{2\cos\theta} = \int d\theta = \theta + C = \arcsin\left(\frac{x}{2}\right) + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-07$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula por sustitución trigonométrica: $\int \frac{dx}{x^2 \sqrt{9 - x^2}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{9 - x^2}} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{x}{3}\\right) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{\\sqrt{9 - x^2}}{9 x} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{\\sqrt{9 - x^2}}{9 x} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $x = 3\sin\theta$, la integral se reduce a $\frac{1}{9}\int \csc^2\theta\,d\theta = -\frac{1}{9}\cot\theta + C = -\frac{\sqrt{9 - x^2}}{9 x} + C$.$exp$),
  ($id$sust-h-08$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula usando $x = 4\tan\theta$: $\int \frac{dx}{\sqrt{x^2 + 16}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}\\arctan\\left(\\frac{x}{4}\\right) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sqrt{x^2 + 16} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln\\left|\\frac{x}{4} + \\sqrt{x^2 + 16}\\right| + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln\\left|x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 16}\\right| + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $x = 4\tan\theta, dx = 4\sec^2\theta\,d\theta$, la integral queda $\int \sec\theta\,d\theta = \ln|\sec\theta + \tan\theta| + C' = \ln|x + \sqrt{x^2 + 16}| + C$.$exp$),
