  ($id$sust-h-10$id$, $sec$calculo-integral$sec$, $sub$sustitucion-trigonometrica$sub$, $law$sustitucion-trigonometrica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula por sustitución trigonométrica: $\int \frac{dx}{x^2 \sqrt{36 - x^2}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{\\sqrt{36 - x^2}}{36 x} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{36 - x^2}} + C","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{6}\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{x}{6}\\right) + C","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{\\sqrt{36 - x^2}}{36 x} + C","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Con $x = 6\sin\theta$, la integral se reduce a $\frac{1}{36}\int \csc^2\theta\,d\theta = -\frac{1}{36}\cot\theta + C = -\frac{\sqrt{36 - x^2}}{36 x} + C$.$exp$),
